                            7
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْهَدَمَ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>It became thrown down, pulled down,
pulled to pieces, demolished,</i> or <i>destroyed:</i> and
<i>it fell in ruins,</i> or <i>to pieces;</i> or <i>became a ruin.</i>
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْهَدَمَ الحَائِطُ مِنْ مَكَانِهِ مِنْ غَيْرِ هَدْمٌ</span> [<i>The
wall fell in ruins,</i> or <i>to pieces, from its place,
without being pulled to pieces</i>]. (Lth, in TA,
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قيض</span>.)

